#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Babelfish plugin"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Babelfish is a machine translation service provided by <ulink url=\"http://"
"babel.altavista.com/\">AltaVista</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The plugin allows you to automatically translate web pages between several "
"languages."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Babelfish plugin can be accessed in the &konqueror; menubar under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Translate Web Page</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Select from the list that drops down the language "
"to translate from and the language to translate to."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have a portion of the text on the page selected, that will be "
"translated instead of the entire &URL;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Not all languages are available from the Babelfish service."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Machine translation is not a perfect science! Babelfish will at best give "
"you a rough translation, and at worst will give you a very funny read. Don't "
"base important decisions on things you have read from a Babelfish translated "
"page, without confirming that the translation is indeed accurate."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may only translate web pages that are accessible on the world wide web. "
"To translate any other text, you should go directly to the Babelfish site "
"itself, where you are able to paste in text for translation."
msgstr ""

